return ['domain'=>'acfml','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'Advanced Custom Fields Multilingual 5.2.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-20 11:27+0000','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-20 11:27+0000','x-generator'=>'PTC (Private Translation Cloud)','messages'=>['Advanced Custom Fields Multilingual'=>'Advanced Custom Fields Multilingual','https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/acfml/'=>'https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/acfml/','Adds compatibility between WPML and Advanced Custom Fields | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/translating-your-contents/acf/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=acfml">Documentation</a>'=>'增加 WPML 與 Advanced Custom Fields 之間的相容性 | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/translating-your-contents/acf/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=acfml">說明文件</a>','OnTheGoSystems'=>'OnTheGoSystems','http://www.onthegosystems.com/'=>'http://www.onthegosystems.com/','Displayed when editing an ACF field in a translation, showing its value in the original language; %1$s and %2$s turn the string into bold, and %3$s is the actual original value.%1$sOriginal%2$s: %3$s'=>'%1$s原始%2$s：%3$s','This type of ACF field will always be set to "Copy once".'=>'此類型的 ACF 欄位將始終設定為「僅複製一次」。','ACF field name:'=>'ACF 欄位名稱：','ACF field type:'=>'ACF 欄位類型：','Translation preferences'=>'翻譯偏好設定','What to do with field\'s value when post/page is going to be translated'=>'當文章/頁面要進行翻譯時，如何處理欄位值','Translate (your current setting, no longer offered for this field type)'=>'翻譯 (您目前的設定，此欄位類型不再提供此選項)','Kept because it is your current setting. This value is no longer offered for this field type.'=>'因這是您目前的設定而予以保留。此欄位類型不再提供此值。','Not recommended for this field type.'=>'不建議用於此欄位類型。','Translated pages start without this content.'=>'已翻譯的頁面在開始時不包含此內容。','Editable in other languages, and starts empty.'=>'可在其他語言中編輯，且初始為空。','Visitors in every language always see exactly what the original shows.'=>'所有語言的訪客看到的內容與原始內容完全相同。','Shown locked in other languages, so it cannot be edited there.'=>'在其他語言中顯示為已鎖定，因此無法在該處編輯。','Starts the same as the original, then each language goes its own way.'=>'初始與原始內容相同，隨後每種語言各自獨立。','Editable in every language, and permanently yours to maintain by hand.'=>'可在每種語言中編輯，並由您永久手動維護。','Visitors see this in their own language.'=>'訪客會看到其對應語言的內容。','Filled by the translation and edited in the translation editor.'=>'由翻譯填寫，並在翻譯編輯器中編輯。','Edit the field to set the translation preference.'=>'編輯欄位以設定翻譯偏好設定。','ACFML is updating translation preferences for strings in Gutenberg Blocks. Keep using your site as usual. This notice will disappear when the process is done.'=>'ACFML 正在更新 Gutenberg 區塊中字串的翻譯偏好設定。請照常使用您的網站。此通知將在程序完成後消失。','ACFML is enabled but not effective. It requires WPML in order to work.'=>'ACFML 已啟用但未生效。它需要 WPML 才能運作。','ACFML is enabled but not effective. It requires Advanced Custom Fields or ACF PRO in order to work.'=>'ACFML 已啟用但未生效。需要 Advanced Custom Fields 或 ACF PRO 才能運作。','Activate Advanced Custom Fields'=>'啟用 Advanced Custom Fields','Install Advanced Custom Fields'=>'安裝 Advanced Custom Fields','Field groups are set to "Translatable" in WPML settings, which prevents ACF fields from being translated.'=>'欄位群組在 WPML 設定中被設為「可翻譯的」，這會導致 ACF 欄位無法被翻譯。','This is almost never intended.'=>'這幾乎不是預期的設定。','A configuration file (wpml-config.xml) controls this setting on this site, so it cannot be changed from here. Edit that file, or ask whoever maintains it to set the ACF field group post type to Not translatable.'=>'設定檔 (wpml-config.xml) 控制此網站上的此項設定，因此無法從此處變更。請編輯該檔案，或要求維護者將 ACF 欄位群組文章類型設為「不可翻譯的」。','Field group copies already created in other languages stay on the site. Changing this setting does not delete them.'=>'已在其他語言中建立的欄位群組複本將保留在網站上。變更此設定不會刪除它們。','Set field groups to Not translatable'=>'將欄位群組設為不可翻譯的','Why this matters'=>'為什麼這很重要','If any field is set to "Translatable", WPML will re-translate the %d posts using this field group.'=>'如果任何欄位設為「翻譯」，WPML 將重新翻譯使用此欄位群組的 %d 篇文章。','Some posts using this field group have translations. Once you change the translation option, WPML needs to update the translation status of the posts. This can take up to 1 minute.'=>'某些使用此欄位群組的文章已有翻譯。一旦您變更翻譯選項，WPML 需要更新文章的翻譯狀態。這可能需要長達 1 分鐘。','Some posts using this field group have translations. Once you change the translation option, WPML needs to update the translation status of the posts. This can take up to %d hours.'=>'某些使用此欄位群組的文章已有翻譯。一旦您變更翻譯選項，WPML 需要更新文章的翻譯狀態。這可能需要長達 %d 小時。','Some posts using this field group have translations. Once you change the translation option, WPML needs to update the translation status of the posts. This can take up to %d minutes.'=>'某些使用此欄位群組的文章已有翻譯。一旦您變更翻譯選項，WPML 需要更新文章的翻譯狀態。這可能需要長達 %d 分鐘。','Locked by WPML so that ACF fields stay translatable. Click here to unlock and change it anyway.'=>'已由 WPML 鎖定，以確保 ACF 欄位保持可翻譯狀態。按一下此處可解鎖並強制變更。','Set translation preferences for the attached taxonomy'=>'為附加的分類法設定翻譯偏好設定','Set translation preferences for the attached post type'=>'為附加的文章類型設定翻譯偏好設定','If you want to translate your fields, go to the WPML Settings page and make the taxonomy attached to this field group translatable. '=>'如果您想翻譯欄位，請前往 WPML 設定頁面，並將附加到此欄位群組的分類法設為可翻譯。 ','If you want to translate your fields, go to the WPML Settings page and %1$smake the post type attached to this field group translatable%2$s.'=>'如果您想翻譯欄位，請前往 WPML 設定頁面並 %1$s將附加到此欄位群組的文章類型設為可翻譯%2$s。','Expert'=>'專家','Same content in every language, translated'=>'在所有語言中使用相同的內容，並進行翻譯','Each language has its own content'=>'每種語言擁有各自的內容','Translate is not offered on container fields, because it replaces the value your theme reads. The fields inside carry their own preferences.'=>'容器欄位不提供「翻譯」選項，因為它會取代佈景主題讀取的值。內部的欄位則帶有各自的偏好設定。','Translate lets each language point at its own address, which an external link often needs. A link to a page on this site already points at that page in the reader\'s language, so leave it as it is.'=>'「Translate」讓每種語言指向各自的地址，這通常是外部連結所需要的。指向本站頁面的連結已經會指向讀者語言的該頁面，因此請保持原樣。','Translate sends the link text and the URL. The target keeps the value you set, and a URL you leave as it is points at the page in the reader\'s language.'=>'「Translate」會傳送連結文字和 URL。目標會保留您設定的數值，而您保持原樣的 URL 則會指向讀者語言的頁面。','Translating an address produces one that does not exist. An e-mail address is the same in every language.'=>'翻譯地址會產生不存在的地址。電子郵件地址在所有語言中都是相同的。','A color code is not language content. Translating it changes the color your visitors see.'=>'顏色代碼不是語言內容。翻譯它會變更訪客看到的顏色。','The stored value is a fixed date format that your theme reads. Translating it breaks the format.'=>'儲存的值是佈景主題讀取的固定日期格式。翻譯它會破壞格式。','The stored value is the choice key, not the label your visitors see. Translating it stops the key from matching your choices. Translate the labels in <b>String Translation</b> instead.'=>'儲存的值是選項鍵值，而非訪客看到的標籤。翻譯它會導致鍵值與您的選項不符。請改在 <b>字串翻譯</b> 中翻譯標籤。','This value is read by your theme or plugin code. A translated value can stop matching what the code expects.'=>'此值由您的佈景主題或外掛程式程式碼讀取。翻譯後的值可能無法符合程式碼的預期。','The file decides this again on every import, so changes made elsewhere do not stick.'=>'檔案會在每次匯入時重新決定此項，因此在其他地方所做的變更將無法保留。','Edit %s, or remove the entry there, to manage this field on this screen.'=>'編輯 %s，或移除該處的項目，以便在此畫面上管理此欄位。','Edit the configuration file, or remove the entry there, to manage this field on this screen.'=>'編輯設定檔，或移除該處的項目，以便在此畫面上管理此欄位。','That is not the value selected above. Saving this field group applies the value above.'=>'這不是上方選取的值。儲存此欄位群組將套用上方的值。','This field group is also in %s. That file re-applies these settings the next time the group is synced.'=>'此欄位群組也存在於 %s 中。該檔案會在下次群組同步時重新套用這些設定。','Locked. Managed by your theme, in its wpml-config.xml file.'=>'已鎖定。由您的佈景主題在其 wpml-config.xml 檔案中管理。','Locked. Managed by a plugin, in its wpml-config.xml file.'=>'已鎖定。由外掛程式在其 wpml-config.xml 檔案中管理。','Locked. Managed by a configuration file WPML downloaded for one of your plugins or themes.'=>'已鎖定。由 WPML 為您的外掛程式或佈景主題下載的設定檔管理。','Locked. Managed by the custom XML configuration saved in WPML settings.'=>'已鎖定。由儲存在 WPML 設定中的自定義 XML 設定管理。','Locked. Managed by a configuration file on this site.'=>'已鎖定。由本站的設定檔管理。','Set in the field group "%s", which uses the same field name.'=>'已在欄位群組「%s」中設定，該群組使用相同的欄位名稱。','Set in the field group\'s local JSON file.'=>'已在欄位群組的本地 JSON 檔案中設定。','Set in the field group\'s local JSON file, %s.'=>'已在欄位群組的本地 JSON 檔案 %s 中設定。','Registered with PHP by your theme or a plugin.'=>'由您的佈景主題或外掛程式透過 PHP 註冊。','Set on the WPML Settings screen (Custom Fields Translation).'=>'已在 WPML 設定畫面 (自定義欄位翻譯) 中設定。','Set here, on this screen.'=>'在此畫面上設定。','Right now this field is translated, so visitors see it in their own language.'=>'目前此欄位已翻譯，因此訪客會看到其對應語言的內容。','Right now this field stays identical in every language.'=>'目前此欄位在所有語言中保持一致。','Right now this field starts as a copy in every language, then each language keeps its own.'=>'目前此欄位在所有語言中初始為複本，隨後各語言各自獨立。','Right now this field stays out of translations.'=>'目前此欄位不包含在翻譯中。','Don\'t translate'=>'不翻譯','Copy'=>'複製','Copy once'=>'僅複製一次','Translate'=>'翻譯','Field groups'=>'欄位群組','Fields'=>'欄位','Posts'=>'文章','Review them one by one'=>'逐一檢視','Apply the recommended setup to %d group'=>'套用建議設定至全部 %d 個項目','%d ACF field group is not configured for translation.'=>'%d 個 ACF 欄位群組尚未設定翻譯。','%d post'=>'%d 篇文章','%1$s field, used on %2$s, would be skipped and stay in %3$s.'=>'用於 %2$s 的 %1$s 個欄位將會略過，並保留為%3$s。','%1$s field, used on %2$s, would be skipped and stay untranslated.'=>'用於 %2$s 的 %1$s 個欄位將會略過，並保持未翻譯狀態。','You are not allowed to change the translation setup of ACF field groups.'=>'您沒有權限變更 ACF 欄位群組的翻譯設定。','You are not allowed to change the WPML translation settings on this site.'=>'您沒有權限變更此網站上的 WPML 翻譯設定。','To change the translation options for custom fields, edit the field group "%s".'=>'若要變更自定義欄位的翻譯選項，請編輯欄位群組「%s」。','These fields come from ACF’s Local JSON files. To change their translation options, go to ACF → Field Groups, sync them, and then edit their settings.'=>'這些欄位來自 ACF 的本地 JSON 檔案。若要變更其翻譯選項，請前往 ACF → 欄位群組，同步它們，然後編輯其設定。','This field and its translation setting are registered via PHP by your theme or plugin. Changes made here will override the original configuration.'=>'此欄位及其翻譯設定是由您的佈景主題或外掛程式透過 PHP 註冊的。在此處所做的變更將覆蓋原始設定。','ACF translation setup'=>'ACF 翻譯設定','Translation setup'=>'翻譯設定','You are not allowed to review the translation setup of ACF field groups.'=>'您沒有權限檢視 ACF 欄位群組的翻譯設定。','Field group'=>'欄位群組','Setup'=>'設定','Actions'=>'動作','This site has no ACF field groups yet.'=>'此網站目前尚無 ACF 欄位群組。','Alert:'=>'警示：','How to do that'=>'如何操作','View fields'=>'檢視欄位','Open Dashboard'=>'開啟儀表板','Apply the recommended setup'=>'套用建議的設定','Every field group stored in this site’s database already has a translation setup.'=>'儲存在此網站資料庫中的每個欄位群組都已有翻譯設定。','Back to the field groups'=>'返回欄位群組','Every field in those groups then gets the translation preference WPML recommends for its field type. A preference that was set by hand in one of them is replaced.'=>'這些群組中的每個欄位隨後都會獲得 WPML 為其欄位類型建議的翻譯偏好設定。其中手動設定的偏好設定將被取代。','Field groups that come from your theme, a plugin’s code, or an acf-json file are not changed. They cannot be saved from here.'=>'來自您的佈景主題、外掛程式程式碼或 acf-json 檔案的欄位群組不會被變更。它們無法從此處儲存。','Cancel'=>'取消','%d field group.'=>'%d 個欄位群組。','All of them have a translation setup.'=>'它們全部都已有翻譯設定。','%d is not configured.'=>'%d 個尚未設定。','Apply recommended setup to the %d unconfigured group'=>'套用建議設定至全部 %d 個未設定的群組','This sets %1$d field group to “%2$s”.'=>'這會將 %1$d 個欄位群組設為「%2$s」。','%d field group is defined in code, so it cannot be configured from here.'=>'%d 個欄位群組是在代碼中定義的，因此無法從此處設定。','Not configured'=>'未配置','Not configured (defined in code)'=>'未配置 (定義於程式碼中)','Set for each field (defined in code)'=>'為每個欄位設定（定義於程式碼中）','Set for each field in WPML Settings (defined in code)'=>'在 WPML 設定中個別設定欄位（在代碼中定義）','%d field set manually'=>'%d 個手動設定的欄位','Nothing decides how these fields are translated. Set %s on the fields in the code that registers this group.'=>'尚未決定如何翻譯這些欄位。請在註冊此群組的程式碼中為欄位設定 %s。','from an acf-json file'=>'來自 acf-json 檔案','from an acf-json file that is newer than this site’s copy'=>'來自比此網站複本更新的 acf-json 檔案','from your theme or a plugin’s code'=>'來自您的佈景主題或外掛程式程式碼','%d field group now uses the recommended setup.'=>'%d 個欄位群組現在使用建議設定。','%d field group has a newer acf-json file waiting to be synced, so that file decides its setup.'=>'%d 個欄位群組有較新的 acf-json 檔案等待同步，因此將由這些檔案決定其設定。','Translation Option'=>'翻譯選項','Multilingual Setup'=>'多語言設定','Loading...'=>'載入中...','Activate <b>String Translation</b>'=>'啟用 <b>字串翻譯</b>','To translate field group names and labels, please %1$sinstall and activate WPML’s String Translation add-on%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯欄位群組名稱與標籤，請 %1$s安裝並啟用 WPML 的字串翻譯外掛程式%2$s。','Activate now'=>'立即啟用','Go back'=>'返回','Set Up <b>Field Group Translation</b>'=>'設定 <b>欄位群組翻譯</b>','To translate field labels from the <b>Translation Management</b> dashboard, finish the <b>Multilingual Setup</b> and save your field group settings.'=>'若要從 <b>翻譯管理</b> 儀表板翻譯欄位標籤，請完成 <b>多語言設定</b> 並儲存您的欄位群組設定。','OK'=>'確定','Translate Field Labels'=>'翻譯欄位標籤','To translate field labels, use the <b>Translation Management</b> dashboard.'=>'若要翻譯欄位標籤，請使用 <b>翻譯管理</b> 儀表板。','Translate in <b>Translation Management</b>'=>'在 <b>翻譯管理</b> 中翻譯','Don’t want to translate field labels? %1$sLearn how to disable field label translation%2$s'=>'不想翻譯欄位標籤？ %1$s了解如何停用欄位標籤翻譯%2$s','Field Labels Partly Translated'=>'欄位標籤部分已翻譯','Some field labels in this group are still untranslated. To finish translating them, go to the <b>Translation Management</b> dashboard.'=>'此群組中的某些欄位標籤尚未翻譯。若要完成翻譯，請前往 <b>翻譯管理</b> 儀表板。','Fields Labels Already Translated'=>'欄位標籤已全部翻譯','You already translated all field labels in this group. To update any translations, go to the <b>Translation Management</b> dashboard.'=>'您已翻譯此群組中的所有欄位標籤。若要更新任何翻譯，請前往 <b>翻譯管理</b> 儀表板。','Go to <b>Translation Management</b>'=>'前往 <b>翻譯管理</b>','Select a translation option for this field group'=>'為此欄位群組選取翻譯選項','Visitors everywhere see the same pages, in their own language. Text is translated; layout and settings stay identical.'=>'各地訪客看到的頁面相同，但使用其對應語言。文字會被翻譯；版面配置與設定保持一致。','You translate in the WPML <b>Translation Editor</b>. This works with automatic translation and <b>Translate Everything</b>.'=>'您在 WPML <b>翻譯編輯器</b> 中進行翻譯。這適用於自動翻譯與 <b>翻譯所有內容</b>。','Every language’s pages are written and maintained on their own. Fields start as a copy of the original, then go their own way.'=>'每個語言的頁面都是獨立編寫與維護的。欄位初始為原始內容的複本，隨後各自獨立。','You edit each language in the WordPress editor. WPML does not sync them afterwards, and automatic translation does not apply.'=>'您在 WordPress 編輯器中編輯每種語言。WPML 隨後不會同步它們，且自動翻譯不適用。','If you are migrating a site, your existing field groups will use the Expert setup. This allows you to manually choose the translation option for each field in the group.'=>'如果您正在遷移網站，現有的欄位群組將使用「專家」設定。這允許您手動為群組中的每個欄位選擇翻譯選項。','This option is %1$snot recommended%2$s for new field groups.'=>'此選項 %1$s不建議%2$s 用於新的欄位群組。','Expert setup documentation'=>'專家設定說明文件','Choose'=>'選擇','recommended for this site'=>'建議此網站使用','Change option'=>'變更選項','A Much Simpler Way to Translate Your ACF Sites'=>'翻譯 ACF 網站的更簡單方法','This new release of ACFML allows you to configure multilingual sites in one-click, instead of many complex settings. Choose how to setup the translation for the fields.'=>'此新版本的 ACFML 允許您一鍵配置多語言網站，而無需進行許多複雜的設定。請選擇如何設定欄位的翻譯。','Go to WPML Settings'=>'前往 WPML 設定','Need help choosing?'=>'需要選擇建議嗎？','Documentation'=>'說明文件','How to translate field labels »'=>'如何翻譯欄位標籤 »','This setup translates field values.'=>'此設定會翻譯欄位值。','Translate field labels and dropdown choice labels separately. Find them under ACF Field Group in the <b>Translation Dashboard</b>.'=>'欄位標籤與下拉選單選項標籤需分開翻譯。您可以在<b>翻譯儀表板</b>中的 ACF Field Group 下找到這些標籤。','Review these translation setting changes'=>'檢視這些翻譯設定變更','Saving this field group makes these changes:'=>'儲存此欄位群組將進行以下變更：','%1$s: from “%2$s” to “%3$s”'=>'%1$s：從「%2$s」變更為「%3$s」','Switching to the field-by-field setup keeps every field\'s current setting. From here you set each field yourself.'=>'切換到逐個欄位設定將保留每個欄位目前的設定。從此處開始，您將自行設定每個欄位。','New translations use the new settings automatically.'=>'新的翻譯將自動使用新設定。','Not set'=>'未設定','No posts with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again.'=>'目前尚無帶有翻譯的文章使用此欄位群組，因此無需重新傳送任何內容。','No terms with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again.'=>'目前尚無帶有翻譯的詞彙使用此欄位群組，因此無需重新傳送任何內容。','No posts or terms with translations use this field group yet, so nothing has to be sent again.'=>'目前尚無帶有翻譯的文章或詞彙使用此欄位群組，因此無需重新傳送任何內容。','Only apply to new translations'=>'僅套用於新的翻譯','Checking how much content this affects...'=>'正在檢查受影響的內容數量...','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','No, go back'=>'不，返回','Updating them sends them for translation again, which may use translation words.'=>'更新它們會再次將其送去翻譯，這可能會消耗翻譯字數。','Updating them marks their translations as needing an update. WPML does not send them for translation. You can send them from the Translation Dashboard.'=>'更新這些內容會將其翻譯標記為需要更新。WPML 不會將其送交翻譯。您可以從翻譯儀表板傳送它們。','Switching the setup applies the recommended value to the %d field in this group.'=>'切換設定會將建議的值套用至此群組中的全部 %d 個欄位。','%d post already has translations that used the old settings.'=>'%d 篇文章已有使用舊設定的翻譯。','%d term already has translations that used the old settings.'=>'%d 個詞彙已有使用舊設定的翻譯。','%d post uses this field group.'=>'%d 篇文章使用此欄位群組。','%d post is translated by hand, so WPML does not send it for translation.'=>'%d 篇文章是手動翻譯的，因此 WPML 不會將它們送交翻譯。','Also update the %d existing post'=>'同時更新 %d 篇現有文章','Also update the %d existing term'=>'同時更新 %d 個現有詞彙','Also update the %1$d existing posts and %2$d terms'=>'同時更新現有的 %1$d 篇文章與 %2$d 個詞彙','Also update the %1$d existing post and %2$d terms'=>'同時更新現有的 %1$d 篇文章與 %2$d 個詞彙','Also update the %1$d existing posts and %2$d term'=>'同時更新現有的 %1$d 篇文章與 %2$d 個詞彙','Also update the %1$d existing post and %2$d term'=>'同時更新現有的 %1$d 篇文章與 %2$d 個詞彙','This field group is shown on an Options page.'=>'此欄位群組顯示在選項頁面上。','That is usually site-wide content like your header, footer, or global blocks.'=>'那通常是全站內容，例如您的頁首、頁尾或全域區塊。','To translate that content, use the %1$sWPML Translation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'若要翻譯該內容，請使用 %1$sWPML 翻譯儀表板%2$s。','The options below still decide how each field behaves: translated, copied to every language, or kept separately per language.'=>'下方的選項仍會決定每個欄位的行為：翻譯、複製到每種語言，或為每種語言分別保留。','This field group also appears on an Options page.'=>'此欄位群組也出現在選項頁面上。','That content is translated in the %1$sWPML Translation Dashboard%2$s, and the option you choose here decides how each of its fields behaves.'=>'該內容已在 %1$sWPML 翻譯儀表板%2$s 中翻譯，您在此處選擇的選項將決定其每個欄位的行為。','Post Type Translation'=>'文章類型翻譯','Labels Translation'=>'標籤翻譯','Taxonomy Translation'=>'分類法翻譯','Finish the ACF <b>Multilingual Setup</b>'=>'完成 ACF <b>多語言設定</b>','Before you can start translating, you need to edit each ACF Field Group to set a translation option for the fields inside it.'=>'在開始翻譯之前，您需要編輯每個 ACF 欄位群組，以為其中的欄位設定翻譯選項。','Read more about %1$show to translate your ACF custom fields%2$s'=>'閱讀更多關於 %1$s如何翻譯您的 ACF 自定義欄位%2$s','%1$sSet translation options%2$s'=>'%1$s設定翻譯選項%2$s','Let\'s Start Translating!'=>'讓我們開始翻譯吧！','Edit each Field Group to select a translation option for the fields inside it. If you don\'t set a translation option, you will not be able to translate your fields.'=>'編輯每個欄位群組，為其中的欄位選擇翻譯選項。如果您未設定翻譯選項，將無法翻譯您的欄位。','A field in "%s" has the same name as a field in another field group. WPML stores translation preferences by field name, so two fields that share a name cannot be set differently.'=>'「%s」中的某個欄位與另一個欄位群組中的欄位名稱相同。WPML 依據欄位名稱儲存翻譯偏好設定，因此共用名稱的兩個欄位無法進行不同的設定。','Some fields in "%s" have the same name as fields in other field groups. WPML stores translation preferences by field name, so fields that share a name cannot be set differently.'=>'「%s」中的某些欄位與其他欄位群組中的欄位名稱相同。WPML 依據欄位名稱儲存翻譯偏好設定，因此共用名稱的欄位無法進行不同的設定。','What you set here may not be what your visitors get'=>'您在此處的設定可能與訪客看到的內容不符','The field %1$s also exists in "%2$s". Rename this field to give it a translation setting of its own.'=>'欄位 %1$s 也存在於「%2$s」中。請重新命名此欄位，以便為其提供專屬的翻譯設定。','See both fields'=>'查看這兩個欄位','Go to Media Translation settings'=>'前往媒體翻譯設定','This content has ACF image, gallery, or file fields, but the alt text, caption, and title of their media will not be sent for translation. To include them, turn on "Translate Media Library texts when translating content" in WPML Media Translation settings.'=>'此內容包含 ACF 圖片、資源庫或檔案欄位，但其媒體的替代文字、標題和說明將不會被傳送進行翻譯。若要包含這些內容，請在 WPML Media Translation 設定中開啟「翻譯內容時，也翻譯媒體庫文字」。','Media texts are not being translated'=>'媒體文字未被翻譯','%1$sGo to Media Translation settings%2$s'=>'%1$s前往媒體翻譯設定%2$s','Translate this Options page from the <b>Translation Dashboard</b>'=>'從 <b>翻譯儀表板</b> 翻譯此選項頁面','You no longer need to switch the admin language to translate options manually. Translate all your options from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'您不再需要切換管理介面語言來手動翻譯選項。請從 %1$s翻譯儀表板%2$s 翻譯您的所有選項。','Go to the Translation Dashboard'=>'前往翻譯儀表板','To change a finished translation, go to %1$sTranslation Jobs%2$s and click on the Edit Translation icon.'=>'若要變更已完成的翻譯，請前往 %1$s翻譯工作%2$s 並按一下「編輯翻譯」圖示。','Go to Translation Jobs'=>'前往翻譯工作','WPML blocked this save to prevent data loss. The form sent about %1$s fields, but the PHP max_input_vars limit on this server (%2$s) let fewer through. Saving now would permanently delete the fields that did not arrive, including repeater rows. Nothing was saved. Ask your host to raise max_input_vars above %1$s and save again.'=>'WPML 已封鎖此儲存動作以防止資料遺失。表單傳送了約 %1$s 個欄位，但此伺服器上的 PHP max_input_vars 限制僅允許 (%2$s) 個通過。現在儲存將會永久刪除未送達的欄位（包括重複欄位列）。目前未儲存任何內容。請要求您的主機商將 max_input_vars 提高至 %1$s 以上，然後再次儲存。','Save blocked to prevent data loss'=>'已封鎖儲存以防止資料遺失','You need to %1$stranslate this post manually%2$s because the field groups attached to it use different translation options:'=>'您需要 %1$s手動翻譯此文章%2$s，因為附加到該文章的欄位群組使用了不同的翻譯選項：','and %d more.'=>'以及另外 %d 個。','Show all field groups'=>'顯示所有欄位群組','and %d more'=>'以及另外 %d 個','You need to translate this post manually because the field groups attached to it use different translation options: %s.'=>'您需要手動翻譯此文章，因為附加到該文章的欄位群組使用了不同的翻譯選項：%s。','Edit %s'=>'編輯 %s','Go to documentation'=>'前往說明文件','This field value is copied from the default language and will be kept in sync across languages.'=>'此欄位值是從預設語言複製而來，並將在各語言之間保持同步。','Synchronise translations'=>'同步翻譯','Keep repeater and flexible sub-fields in the same order as the default language.'=>'保持重複欄位和彈性內容子欄位的順序與預設語言一致。','ACFML Synchronise translations'=>'ACFML 同步翻譯','Translate ACF Local JSON and PHP-Registered Fields'=>'翻譯 ACF 本地 JSON 和 PHP 註冊的欄位','ACF allows you to %1$sregister fields via PHP%2$s or %3$ssave field settings as JSON files%4$s. You can also save post types, taxonomies, or options pages settings to JSON files.'=>'ACF 允許您 %1$s透過 PHP 註冊欄位%2$s 或 %3$s將欄位設定儲存為 JSON 檔案%4$s。您也可以將文章類型、分類法或選項頁面設定儲存到 JSON 檔案中。','Configure how ACF Multilingual handles translations for these items.'=>'設定 ACF Multilingual 如何處理這些項目的翻譯。','Sync <b>Translation Preferences</b> for Local Fields'=>'同步本地欄位的 <b>翻譯偏好設定</b>','Don’t sync translation preferences'=>'不要同步翻譯偏好設定','Sync once now'=>'立即同步一次','Sync on every request (may affect performance)'=>'每次請求時同步（可能會影響效能）','Register Labels for Translation'=>'註冊標籤以進行翻譯','Scans post types, taxonomies, options pages, and field groups stored in the "acf-json" directory, then registers their labels with WPML so you can translate them.'=>'掃描儲存在「acf-json」目錄中的文章類型、分類法、選項頁面和欄位群組，然後向 WPML 註冊其標籤，以便您翻譯它們。','Don’t register labels'=>'不要註冊標籤','Register labels now'=>'立即註冊標籤','Apply'=>'套用','The synchronization of translation preferences is disabled.'=>'翻譯偏好設定的同步已停用。','Translation preferences synchronized.'=>'翻譯偏好設定已同步。','The synchronization of translation preferences is enabled.'=>'翻譯偏好設定的同步已啟用。','%s group'=>'%s 個群組','%s post type'=>'%s 個文章類型','%s taxonomy'=>'%s 個分類法','%s options page'=>'%s 個選項頁面','No local field groups, post types, taxonomies, or Options pages were found.'=>'找不到本地欄位群組、文章類型、分類法或選項頁面。','Used between elements of a two elements list and '=>' 與 ','Used before the last element of a three or more elements list, and '=>'，以及 ','Successfully registered labels for %s.'=>'已成功註冊 %s 的標籤。','%1$sChange translation settings%2$s'=>'%1$s變更翻譯設定%2$s','%1$sTranslate labels%2$s'=>'%1$s翻譯標籤%2$s','Not translatable'=>'不可翻譯的','Translatable'=>'可翻譯的','only show translated items'=>'僅顯示已翻譯的項目','use translation if available or fallback to default language'=>'若有翻譯則使用翻譯，否則回退至預設語言','This content must be translated manually due to the translation option you selected for the "%1$s" field group.'=>'由於您為「%1$s」欄位群組選擇的翻譯選項，此內容必須手動翻譯。']];